+## 2026-06-10 (GAP-4 ARC-2 transfer probe — honest decay calibration, 5/5 adversarially confirmed — outer-loop, Claude Fable 5)
+
+- [outer-loop] Operator approved the recommended path (sandbox hardening + arc_v2/ARC-2-eval probe). **Hardening:** exec timeout + numpy-I/O/`type(` token blocks + 2 regression tests; full per-call codex transcript archiving added to the GAP-4 pipeline (closing the panel's auditability hole); GAP-4 script + pool exporter parameterized. Post-round second fix: word-boundary regex matching after the panel caught substring false-rejections (`astype(` matched `type(`, `pos.` matched `os.` — 5/5 blacklist hits were false positives; +1 regression test, 10 total, all pass).
+- **Infrastructure:** rebuilt `data/arc2concept-aug-1000` locally from the documented TRM build command (9.0 GB, deterministic — identifier table aligned with the published arc_v2 checkpoint exactly: ids=1191730, no embedding reset). Capped arc_v2 eval dump (120 batches, 35 min GPU, conductor paused/restored): TRM arc_v2 on ARC-2 eval is very weak (indicative pass@2 0.0125). New pool: 31 entries / 23 unique tasks / 20,379 candidates, only 4 oracle entries (`results/arc3_gap4_arc2_eval_pool.json.gz`).
+- **Probe run (56 codex calls / 96 min, transcripts archived): `results/arc3_gap4_arc2_rule_exec_verifier.json`.** The two-point transfer curve (vs ARC-1): induction 0.93 → 0.57 unique-task (post-regrade 13/23); precision P(gold|demo-perfect) 0.90 → 0.47; true-gold 0.839 → 0.258; rerank nil (the exact-match gate fired 0/31 — TRM arc_v2's pool lacks codex's answers entirely; codex-gold and TRM-oracle sets fully disjoint).
+- **Adversarial round (`results/arc3_gap4_arc2_adversarial_verify.json`): 5/5 CONFIRMED, worst severity minor.** All numbers bit-exact; all 56 transcripts leak-clean (first round where the no-oracle invariant is AUDITED, not asserted). Load-bearing finding: **the decay is honest induction strain, not collapse-to-recall** — demo-overfit rises 10.3% → 50% (memorization predicts the opposite signature) and the maximally-exposed task (16b78196, content-identical 5-years-public ARC-1-eval reuse) fails completely at demo_fit 0.0. Corollary stamped into the record: ARC-1's 0.897 precision is an UPPER BOUND on genuine induction; the probe is "reduced-exposure, increased-difficulty", never "held-out" (evaluation2 is public-era; 2/23 tasks are verbatim ARC-1-eval reuses). The one live rerank signal: a prediction 1/493 cells from gold that GRADED min-hamming promoted to rank 1 where the exact-match gate missed — exact-match gating is too brittle on hard tasks.
+- **Ledger (`ops/verifier_gaps.md` GAP-4): calibrated two-point claim + panel-ranked next moves** — (1) k=2–3 independent-induction agreement gate (micro-evidence: agreed pairs gold 3/3 vs 0.50 unconditional); (2) graded execution-energy gate (min-hamming ≤ 0.005), validated on ARC-1 first; (3) adaptive iteration caps + ≥600s timeouts (67% of codex-seconds burned on never-perfect tasks); (4) local open-weight generator arm; (5) the 400-task run deferred until (1)/(2) land — the gate is structurally inert where the base generator is weak, so scale cannot help the rerank framing.
